## Project Context

**App**: isf-app — ZISWAF Platform (Zakat + Wakaf)
**Services**: web-vue (Vue 3), bff-api (BFF), api-python (business logic), report-api (laporan)

2 portals × 2 databases:

| Portal | Business DB    | Auth DB           | Web  | BFF  |
|--------|---------------|-------------------|------|------|
| Zakat  | `mziss_laz`   | `isf_auth_zakat`  | 5173 | 7000 |
| Wakaf  | `mziss_wakaf` | `isf_auth_wakaf`  | 5174 | 7001 |

DB credentials: `transaction:solusi`
Frontend ONLY calls bff-api (`VITE_API_BASE_URL`). Never call api-python/report-api directly.

