## Workflow: Migrasi Legacy

```
Baca docs/legacy-apps/{modul}/*.{mnu,svr,dfr}
  → aktifkan skill nuwis-daf-reader
  → buat MIGRATION_ANALYSIS (dialog, fields, logic, discriminators)
  → buat specs.md + plan.md
  → tunggu konfirmasi
  → jalankan 7-layer workflow di atas
  → aktifkan skill nuwis-parity-check untuk validasi
```

---

## Workflow: Tambah Laporan

```
1. aktifkan skill nuwis-pg-migration → buat dwh.v_{nama} di infra/db/migrations/dwh/
2. aktifkan skill nuwis-fastapi-isf → buat report-api module (service + router + export)
3. aktifkan skill nuwis-bff-proxy → tambah stream_report_api route di BFF
4. aktifkan skill nuwis-seed-sql → seed menu + role_menu
5. aktifkan skill nuwis-vue-isf → buat LaporanXPage.vue (no auto-load, DateField, dmy())
```

